<title>UK: DATED BRENT FIRMS TO TRADE AT SEPT BRENT -15 CENTS.</title>
<headline>DATED BRENT FIRMS TO TRADE AT SEPT BRENT -15 CENTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dated Brent traded five cents firmer on Tuesday as a third decade cargo was sold for Sept Brent -15 cents a barrel, traders said.</p>
<p>The Aug 23-25 cargo was sold by a Wall Street trader to a U.S. major, they added.</p>
<p>The last reported Dated Brent deal was on Thursday when an Aug 20-22 cargo fetched Sept Brent -20 cents.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
